<h2 class="text-center">How To Apply</h2>
<p>Our application process is completely web-based and designed to be simple and transparent:</p>
<ol>
    <li>Browse our open positions on the <strong>Careers</strong> page.</li>
    <li>Submit your resume and basic information through our secure online form.</li>
    <li>Complete a short skills and preferences questionnaire.</li>
    <li>Participate in a virtual screening call with one of our recruiters.</li>
    <li>We coordinate interviews directly with hiring managers and keep you updated by email.</li>
</ol>

<p>
    Once you apply, you'll receive a confirmation email within minutes. Our team reviews every application and typically responds within 3-5 business days. IF we don't have the perfect role right now, we'll keep your profile in our talent network and reach out when a matching opportunity opens."
</p>
<hr />

<h2 class="text-center">Join Our Team!</h2>
<p>
    We're always looking for passionate recruiters, sourcers, and coordinators who care about connecting people with meaningful work. Visit the <strong><a href="https://localhost:7227/OurTeam">Our Team</a></strong> page to learn more about the people behind Cincinnati Consulting Company and see if our culture is a fit for you.
</p>
<hr />

<h2 class="text-center">Questions?</h2>
<p>
    Leave us a message if you have any questions about our services, the application process, or how we can help your organization find top talent. Our team will respond within 24 hours.
</p>
<form action="Questions" method="get">
    <div class="form-row">
        <label for="name">Name:</label>
        <input type="text" id="name" name="name" />
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
        <label for="phone">Phone Number:</label>
        <input type="text" id="phone" name="phone" />
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
        <label for="email">Email:</label>
        <input type="text" id="email" name="email" />
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
        <label for="question">Question:</label>
        <input type="text" id="question" name="question" />
    </div>
    <p>How would you like to be contacted?</p>
    <blockquote><input type="checkbox" name="Call" /> Call</blockquote>
    <blockquote><input type="checkbox" name="Text" /> Text</blockquote>
    <blockquote><input type="checkbox" name="Email" /> Email</blockquote>
    <input type="submit" value="Submit" />
</form>
<br />